sum }_{j=1}^{3}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}\\frac{i}{j} & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}[{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}\\frac{i}{j}] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}(\\frac{1}{j}+\\frac{2}{j}+\\frac{3}{j}) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}\\frac{6}{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we sum over the index $j:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{3}\\frac{6}{j} & =\\frac{6}{1}+\\frac{6}{2}+\\frac{6}{3} \\\\  & =6+3+2 \\\\  & =11\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72398/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8537cc22-8d18-57c8-9ebf-921bd4d06ae7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72398"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-72094"] :question/problem "${\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}ij=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write out the inner summation by summing over the index $i:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}ij & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}[{\\sum }_{i=1}^{3}ij] \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}(1j+2j+3j) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}(j+2j+3j) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}6j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we sum over the index $j:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{2}6j & =6\\cdot 1+6\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =6+12 \\\\  & =18\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-72397/selection/a84d639d380e10cb74c92005685f9f65779377dfb51342c280c63c645679bbea" :answer/id #uuid "6c1fded8-cdf1-53a7-9028-1019989f85b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72397/selection/442511f9b0fecd2a08a6dca7fc8cc4e966d1876da93632eb687adf93cc074fd5" :answer/id #uuid "34013482-073d-579e-854a-e37119c01bb8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "79" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72397/selection/ebe3072a1dd0240f82f7c04e06603ef971401ed1aea6a421c38664ef5adb09f3" :answer/id #uuid "6dd4bc82-046c-5669-8ac6-2bbb7b4afeb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value