n/problem "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}5{b}_{j}({a}_{i}-4)\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i}=85,\\,{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j}=18.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}5{b}_{j}({a}_{i}-4) & ={\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}5{b}_{j}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}({a}_{i}-4).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}5{b}_{j}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}({a}_{i}-4) & =(5{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i}-{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}4) \\\\  & =(5{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i}-4{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}1) \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 18)\\cdot (85-4\\cdot 20) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (85-80) \\\\  & =(90)\\cdot (5) \\\\  & =450\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-149726/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "08375770-c610-5dae-b01b-c457de086cba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-149726"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-149689/selection/f1a3f6364b4b6488166c92c743a5a8e2e2bdb28aff5bc6025ac2678cb4926932" :answer/id #uuid "f4213ce7-177c-5378-9156-1647268250c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "200" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149689/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" :answer/id #uuid "0ac9d4a3-18ae-5718-b24c-7a3ce224ff56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "150" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149689/selection/ce031d56f3b45ef72348f95903ab22c6327c13df980590fbbec05fe977a79394" :answer/id #uuid "16ac06ac-ef2e-5891-a039-c1186b2f57bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :a