ligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}({b}_{j}-5) & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{j}-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}5) \\\\  & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{20}{a}_{i})\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}{b}_{j}-5{\\sum }_{j=1}^{10}1) \\\\  & =(25)\\cdot (58-5\\cdot 10) \\\\  & =(25)\\cdot (58-50) \\\\  & =(25)\\cdot (8) \\\\  & =200\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-149689/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "08375770-c610-5dae-b01b-c457de086cba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-149689"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection/f1a3f6364b4b6488166c92c743a5a8e2e2bdb28aff5bc6025ac2678cb4926932" :answer/id #uuid "82bdf342-b574-5c57-98aa-ece7bf7b1467" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "200" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection/23191a7abb2085fa58cfcf0bd067eedb8c4feb2e427bc3ee2024594244bb9b18" :answer/id #uuid "f92600b6-ccdc-5f05-8549-91586156e7e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "180" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection/2dc9539b1cae5422841480b1cf8698050a67f73e90df6bc3af3be02ebaa8e890" :answer/id #uuid "164ea086-02a6-5a61-85a3-304a248c6b26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "140" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" :answer/id #uuid "89838c03-95f3-59de-8a38-78953c0c4256" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "150" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection/ae1ec0bcc83ac82fe7d363f2ad54fe23dc343f2913e126433b39173ac74d85e6" :answer/id #uuid "2228c6dd-b6bb-5f23-8cfa-b729e1fdd585" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "160" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b80a7566-9422-5319-b592-891744f3ed13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-149717/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" :answer-field/choices ["q-149717/selection/f1a3f6364b4b6488166c92c743a5a8e2e2bdb28aff5bc6025ac2678cb4926932" "q-149717/selection/23191a7abb2085fa58cfcf0bd067eedb8c4feb2e427bc3ee2024594244bb9b18" "q-149717/selection/2dc9539b1cae5422841480b1cf8698050a67f73e90df6bc3af3be02ebaa8e890" "q-149717/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" "q-149717/selection/ae1ec0bcc83ac82fe7d363f2ad54fe23dc343f2913e126433b39173ac74d85e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-149717" :question/id #uuid "d7bc6551-7fff-58fa-9ef3-72e47d44ac8f" :question/math-academy-id "q-149717" :question/problem "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({a}_{i}+1)({b}_{j}-1)\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{a}_{i}=20,\\,{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j}=26.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The product rule for double summations states that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{i}{b}_{j}={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{a}_{i}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, using the product rule for double summations, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({a}_{i}+1)({b}_{j}-1) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}({a}_{i}+1){\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({b}_{j}-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the rules for single summations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}({a}_{i}+1){\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}({b}_{j}-1) & =({\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{a}_{i}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}1)\\cdot ({\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}{b}_{j}-{\\sum }_{j=1}^{20}1) \\\\  & =(20+5)\\cdot (26-20) \\\\  & =(25)\\cdot (6) \\\\  & =150.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-149717/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "08375770-c610-5dae-b01b-c457de086cba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-149717"] :db/ensure [:kn